# CI/CD Setup
RULE: Follow complete CI/CD setup: Act for local simulation, Docker test-in-image, Cloud Build, GitHub Actions.
WHY: Ensures consistent CI/CD across all repos; catches issues before push.
CODEX: 05-infrastructure/cicd-setup.md
DO: Test with Act locally; run quality gates inside Docker; use environment-aware builds
NEVER: Skip Act testing; push without local quality gates; hardcode project IDs in workflows
